POST /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/teamnet/routes/network/{ip_network_encoded}
Routes a private network through a Cloudflare Tunnel. The CIDR in `ip_network_encoded` must be written in URL-encoded format.
Required: ip_network_encoded (path); account_id (path); body (body)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/teamnet/routes/{route_id}
Deletes a private network route from an account.
Required: route_id (path); account_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/teamnet/routes/{route_id}
Get a private network route in an account.
Required: account_id (path); route_id (path)

PATCH /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/teamnet/routes/{route_id}
Updates an existing private network route in an account. The fields that are meant to be updated should be provided in the body of the request.
Required: route_id (path); account_id (path); body (body)

PATCH /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/teamnet/routes/network/{ip_network_encoded}
Updates an existing private network route in an account. The CIDR in `ip_network_encoded` must be written in URL-encoded format.
Required: ip_network_encoded (path); account_id (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/teamnet/virtual_networks/{virtual_network_id}
Deletes an existing virtual network.
Required: virtual_network_id (path); account_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/teamnet/virtual_networks/{virtual_network_id}
Get a virtual network.
Required: account_id (path); virtual_network_id (path); body (body)

PATCH /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/teamnet/virtual_networks/{virtual_network_id}
Updates an existing virtual network.
Required: account_id (path); virtual_network_id (path); body (body)
